wn\"></i></button></li><li></li></ul><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__burger\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><i class=\"bx bx-menu\"></i></button></div></nav><main><div class=\"page-module__rPGSUq__page\"><div style=\"padding-top:80px\"><section class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__wrapper\"><div class=\"glassCard AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__profileContainer\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__leftCol\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__headerSection\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__titleBox\"><h1 class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__wikiName\">Erine</h1><a href=\"https://www.idn.app/jkt48_erine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__followBtn\">+ Follow</a></div><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__jpName\">Japan : エリーヌ</span></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tableContainer\"><table class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__bioTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Nama Asli</td><td>Catherina Vallencia Kurniawan</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Nama Panggilan</td><td>Erine</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Tanggal Lahir</td><td>21 Agustus 2007<!-- --> <span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ageDim\">(Usia <!-- -->19<!-- -->)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Kota Asal</td><td><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__hometownContainer\"><span>Bekasi, Jawa Barat, Indonesia</span><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__mapIcon\"><img src=\"/images/bekasi.png\" alt=\"Bekasi\"/></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Golongan Darah</td><td>B</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Zodiak</td><td>♌︎ Leo</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Tinggi Badan</td><td>162 cm</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__labelCell\">Tim</td><td>Passion</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__jikoBar\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__jikoLeft\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__jikoLabel\">Jikoshoukai</div><button class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__audioBtn\"><i class=\"bx bx-play\"></i></button></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__jikoQuoteBox\">Hadir dengan seribu kejutan,<br/><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__checkmateAnim\">Checkmate!</span><br/>Siap memenangkan hatimu.</div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socialSection\" id=\"sosmed\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socialTitle\">Erine&#x27;s Social Media</div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socialIcons\"><a href=\"https://x.com/CErine_JKT48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M12.6.75h2.454l-5.36 6.142L16 15.25h-4.937l-3.867-5.07-4.425 5.07H.316l5.733-6.57L0 .75h5.063l3.495 4.633L12.601.75Zm-.86 13.028h1.36L4.323 2.145H2.865l8.875 11.633Z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jkt48.erine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><i class=\"bx bxl-instagram\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@jkt48.erine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><i class=\"bx bxl-facebook-circle\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@jkt48.erine_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><i class=\"bx bxl-tiktok\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.showroom-live.com/r/JKT48_Erine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><img src=\"/images/showroom.png\" alt=\"Showroom\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%\"/></a><a href=\"https://www.idn.app/jkt48_erine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__socIcon\"><img src=\"/images/idn.png\" alt=\"IDN\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%\"/></a></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__rightCol\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__mainPhotoFrame\"></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__galleryStrip\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__thumbsGrid\"></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__galleryLink\">See<!-- --> <a href=\"/gallery\"><strong>gallerine</strong></a> <!-- -->for more!</div></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewContainer\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewIntro\"><h3>Introduction</h3><p>Erine adalah member JKT48 generasi ke-12. Erine dikenal sebagai<!-- --> <!-- -->&quot;Putri Bebek&quot; oleh fans karena kepribadiannya yang unik dan menggemaskan.</p></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewSplit\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewBio\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Debut</td><td>18 November 2023</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Tahun Aktif</td><td>Member JKT48 Gen 12</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Member Favorit</td><td><a href=\"https://x.com/I_KathrinaJKT48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kathrina Irene</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">MBTI</td><td>ISFP / INFP</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Shio</td><td>Babi</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Hobi</td><td>Bermain Piano, Menari</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Angka Favorit</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl\">Warna Favorit</td><td>Pink, Blue, Tosca</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewHt\"><p class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewHtTitle\"># Official Hashtags</p><ul><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Setiap Hari Jumat</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#DiesVenErine</span></li><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Setiap Jurnal</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#MemoRine</span></li><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Setiap Sahur</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#SahuRine</span></li><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Sebelum Berbuka</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#Ngabuburine</span></li><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Setiap Berbuka</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#BukbeRine</span></li><li><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__lbl2\">Setiap Game</span><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#GameRine</span></li></ul><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewPm\"><img src=\"/images/pm.png\" alt=\"PM\"/><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__tag\">#NgabaRine</span></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__ewFf\"><h3>Funfact Erine</h3><ol><li>Penampilan pertamanya sebagai penari latar di JKT48 Stage ke-5 untuk lagu Glory Days adalah pada tanggal 1 Februari 2025.</li><li>Suka aespa, terutama member bernama Ningning.</li><li>Cita-cita pengen bawa bendera saat upacara.</li><li>Erine Waktu SMA ada dijurusan IPS.</li><li>Bisa memainkan Kalimba.</li><li>Mata sehat, tidak silinder atau minus.</li><li>Mendaftar JKT48 di hari terakhir pendaftaran.</li><li>Tidak bisa maen catur, &quot;Checkmate&quot; cuman spontan kepikiran.</li></ol></div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__showcaseContainer\"><div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__nailedFrame\"></div><h3 class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__erineTitle\">Erine&#x27;s Video Debut</h3><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__videoFrameWrapper\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__responsiveVideo\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Obxn7knXq38\" title=\"Debut\" allowFullScreen=\"\"></iframe></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__nailedFrame\"></div><h3 class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__erineTitle\">Erine&#x27;s Kabesha</h3><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__galleryGrid\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__frameCard\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__imageContainer\"><img src=\"/images/trainee.jpg\" alt=\"2023\"/></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionBox\"><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionYear\">2023</span>First Kabesha</div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__frameCard\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__imageContainer\"><img src=\"/images/regular.webp\" alt=\"2026\"/></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionBox\"><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionYear\">2026</span>Regular Member</div></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__frameCard\"><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__imageContainer\"><img src=\"/images/erine-passion.webp\" alt=\"2026\"/></div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionBox\"><span class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__captionYear\">2026</span>Team Passion</div></div></div><div><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__nailedFrame\"></div><h3 class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__erineTitle\">7th JKT48 Senbatsu Election</h3><div class=\"AboutErineSection-module__uhJ_pq__frameCardWide\"><div class=\"AboutErineSectio